{"path":"biology/genetics/meiosis/meiosis-image","title":"减数分裂图像判断（2n=4）","type":"example","html":"<p>下图为某动物（体细胞染色体数为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span>）细胞分裂过程的示意图，甲、乙、丙、丁表示分裂的不同时期。下列说法正确的是（ ）</p>\n<p><img src=\"img/biology/meiosis-panels.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>A. 甲细胞处于减数第一次分裂后期</p>\n<p>B. 乙细胞处于减数第一次分裂后期</p>\n<p>C. 丙细胞中染色体数目为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span> 条</p>\n<p>D. 丁细胞中不存在同源染色体</p>\n<ul>\n<li>计数核对表（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span>）：有丝分裂后期 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span> 条、减Ⅰ后期 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> 条（各含姐妹单体）、减Ⅱ后期 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> 条（无姐妹单体）、减Ⅱ中期 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span> 条；</li>\n<li>若图含&quot;细胞质不均等分裂&quot;⇒ 是卵原细胞减Ⅰ/减Ⅱ；均等⇒ 精原细胞或极体（减Ⅱ均等也可能第二极体）；</li>\n<li>真题关联：该类图像组合判断在新课标卷选择题中是常客（考法为&quot;识图+计数+概念辨析&quot;，具体题目以各省真题卷为准，本站内容为同考法自编）。🔗 真题公开资料：<a href=\"https://gaokao.neea.edu.cn/\">中国教育考试网·普通高考</a>（官方试题评析）</li>\n<li>变式：若问&quot;能产生正常精细胞的是哪几个图&quot;——减Ⅰ、减Ⅱ的图像都需形态正确，有丝分裂图不会产生配子。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>看图的三个步骤</strong>（先数同源，再看着丝点）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>甲：染色体 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span> 条，且<strong>有同源染色体</strong>、着丝点已分裂（染色体呈 I 形）⇒ <strong>有丝分裂后期</strong>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> 后期染色体数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2\\times4=8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span>）⇒ A 错；</li>\n<li>乙：染色体 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> 条（同源染色体正在分离，每侧 1 大 1 小）⇒ <strong>减数第一次分裂后期</strong> ✓；</li>\n<li>丙：染色体 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> 条（无同源、着丝点分裂、姐妹染色单体分开成为子染色体）⇒ 减数第二次分裂后期，染色体数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> ⇒ C 错；</li>\n<li>丁：染色体 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> 条，有同源（大、小各一对），着丝点未分裂（X 形排在赤道板）⇒ <strong>有丝分裂中期</strong>，存在同源染色体 ⇒ D 错。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>选 <strong>B</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>&quot;三看口诀&quot;</strong>：图像题只看三个特征——</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>一看同源</strong>（没有⇒减Ⅱ/配子）；<strong>二看着丝点</strong>（分裂⇒后期，未分裂⇒中期）；<strong>三看是否均等</strong>（精/卵次级，细胞质不均=卵）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>乙有同源且着丝点未分裂、同源正在分离 ⇒ 直接锁定<strong>减Ⅰ后期</strong>可 30 秒选 B；</li>\n<li>干扰项套路背熟：减Ⅰ后期说成&quot;有丝分裂后期&quot;（甲就是干这个的）；减Ⅱ后期染色体数写成 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span>；有丝分裂中期说&quot;无同源&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"下图为某动物（体细胞染色体数为 2 n = 4 2n=4 2 n = 4 ）细胞分裂过程的示意图，甲、乙、丙、丁表示分裂的不同时期。下列说法正确的是（ ） A. 甲细胞处于减数第一次分裂后期 B. 乙细胞处于减数第一次分裂后期 C. 丙细胞","source":"自编（经典考法：图像辨析类为新课标卷高频）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"图像判断先数\"有无同源染色体\"再数\"着丝点是否分裂\"——同源分离=减Ⅰ后期、姐妹分离无同源=减Ⅱ后期、两者都有=有丝分裂后期。","fit":["有丝分裂与减数分裂图像辨析","同源染色体/染色单体计数","选填题（配图）"],"updated":"Mon Mar 03 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"genetics","title":"遗传与进化"},{"slug":"meiosis","title":"减数分裂"},{"slug":"meiosis-image","title":"减数分裂图像判断（2n=4）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"meiosis","title":"减数分裂与受精作用","type":"knowledge"}]}